ducation (statistically significant at p<0.05).\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All analyses took complex survey design and sampling weight into account.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"daily intake frequency from both questions was summed and categorized as none\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Values for all states were significantly different at p<0.05 by chi-square test\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}